  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>The system&#39;s only giant, banded in rust and cream, with a ring of ice and silicate dust bright enough to serve as a navigation feature from the inner worlds. Three distinct decks of aerial mat live in its upper atmosphere, at 0.6, 1.1 and 4 bar, and they do not appear to exchange material at all. Fieldwork here means a balloon platform, a long tether and an even longer argument about sample contamination.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
